    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You can focus your entire body into a single, brutal close combat attack. For your Action, you may attempt a <strong>Challenging (+0) Strength</strong> Test. If you succeed, and you successfully attack an opponent before the end of the next Round, you inflict a Critical Wound, ignoring Critical Deflections. You can use Crippling Blow a number of times per encounter equal to your Crippling Blow level. For every +2 SL on the Strength Test, you increase the result on the Critical Wounds Table by +10.</p>"
